hadiths[39]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3272","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh kwn sy awrt sb say bhtr hay tw aap nay frmaya: ”wh jw (shwhr) kw dykh kr razy hw jayay، jb wh hkm day tw as ky ataat kray، awr as kay jan w mal kay baray myn as ky khwahsh kay khlaf kwyy aysa kam nh kray jw asay napsnd hw۔ nsayy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay۔"
"3273","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”char khsltyn aysy hyn kh js kw wh ata ky gyy hyn wh dnya awr aakhrt myn bhtryn hyn: shkr gzar dl، zban jw allh ka zkr krty hay، aysa jsm jw aazmaysh myn sbr ka mzahrh kray، awr wh bywy jw apnay shwhr ya mal myn khyant nh kray۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3274","abn abas nay byan kya kh sabt bn ky bywy۔ qys rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha: \khda kay rswl، myn sabt bn qys kw krdar ya mzhb kay hwalay say mlamt nhyn krta، lykn myn aslam kay baray myn kfr* ka mjrm nhyn bnna chahta۔\"" khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh kya wh asay as ka bagh waps day gy، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh kray gy، tw as nay asay kha kh bagh kw qbwl krw awr ayk tlaq ka aalan krw۔ *mtlb wh asay psnd nhyn krty thy awr as lyay drty thy kh shwhr ky wjh say wh asay azt nh dkhayay۔ kfran، js ka trjmh 'kfr' hay، ka mtlb 'nashkry' bhy hw skta hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3275","abdallh by amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay apny ayk bywy kw hyz ky halt myn tlaq day dy awr jb amr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say yh bat btayy tw aap naraz hwyay awr frmaya: ”wh asay waps lay lay awr asay pak hwnay tk apnay pas rkhay، as kay bad ayk awr hyz aayay awr pak hw jayay، agr asay tlaq dyna achha lgay tw wh hyz say pak hwnay ky swrt myn aysa kr skta hay، js ka antzar allh taalyٰ nay hkm dya hay kh wh hyz say pak hw۔ awrtwn ky tlaq۔\ ayk nskhh hay، \""asay hkm dw kh wh asay waps lay lay، phr jb wh hyz say pak hw، ya hamlh hw tw asay tlaq day dw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3276","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn an ka antkhab dya awr anhwn nay allh awr as kay rswl kw chn lya۔ as lyay asay ksy bhy trh say an ky tlaq myn shmar nhyn kya gya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3277","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha: kwyy shkhs as chyz ka kfarh dyta hay jsay as nay apnay lyay hram kya hw۔ *yany aysy chyz jw bzat khwd najayz nh hw۔ asay twrnay ky qsm ky trh smjha jata hay js ka kfarh dyna zrwry hay۔ nby ky msal ayk mdt kay lyay apny azwaj say knarh kshy ky trf asharh krty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3278","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm zynb bnt jhsh kay sath wqt gzartay thay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk mrtbh an kay ghr shhd pya tha، chnanchh hfsh rzy allh anha awr wh as bat pr mtfq hwyyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm js kay pas phlay tshryf layay wh yh khay: myn nay dykha kh aap kw mymwsh kay mswrhwn ky bdbw aaty hay، kya aap nay kchh khaya hay؟ jb wh an myn say ayk kay pas gya tw as nay yh kha tw as nay jwab dya kh fkr nh krw، myn nay zynb bnt jhsh kay ghr shhd pya tha، lykn myn qsm khata hwn kh aayndh aysa nhyn krwn ga، as kay baray myn ksy kw mt btana۔ apny bywywn kw razy krnay ky aarzw krtay hwyay [as nay yh kha] awr phr nychay aaya، \aay nby، aap apny bywywn kw khwsh krnay kay lyay jw kchh allh nay aap kay lyay hlal kya hay، as kw aap kywn hram smjhtay hyn؟\"" (alqraan 66:1)۔ nagwar (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3279","swban rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy awrt bghyr ksy wjh kay apnay shwhr say tlaq mangay tw as pr jnt ky khwshbw hram hw jayay gy۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3280","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hlal chyz js say allh taalyٰ kw sb say zyadh napsnd hay wh tlaq hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3281","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nkah say phlay tlaq nhyn hay، ksy kay qbzay myn rhnay tk kwyy chhwt nhyn hay، mslsl rwzh nhyn hay، blwght kay bad ytymy nhyn hay، dwdh chhranay kay bad dwdh nhyn plana jayay ga، awr dn bhr rat tk khamwshy nhyn hwgy۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3282","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \aadm ky awlad myn say kwyy aysy chyz ky nzr nhyn kr skta jw as kay pas nhyn hay، ya jw as kay pas nhyn hay asay aazad nhyn kr skta، ya jw as kay pas nhyn hay asay tlaq nhyn day skta۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay، awr abwdaod nay mzyd kha: \""ya wh chyz bych dw jw as kay pas nhyn hay۔\"""""""
"3283","rkanh by۔ abd yzyd nay kha kh myn nay apny bywy shymh kw balkl tlaq day dy awr jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kw as ky atlaa mly tw aap nay frmaya: \myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh yh srf ayk tlaq hay۔\"" khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh kya aysa hay، awr jb as nay asay yqyn dlaya kh yh hay، tw as nay asay apnay pas waps kr dya۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn dwsry tlaq amr rzy allh anh kay dwr myn awr tysry mrtbh asman rzy allh anh kay dwr myn dy۔ abwdaod، trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn srf abwdaod nay dwsry awr tysry mrtbh zkr kya hay (dykhyay abwdaod ky snn، tlaq، 14)۔"""""
"3284","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn chyzyn aysy hyn jn kw khwah snjydgy say kya jayay ya mzaq myn، sngyn smjha jata hay: nkah، tlaq awr tlaq kay bad bywy kw waps lyna jw htmy nhyn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3285","aayshh rzy allh anha nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh ”aql ky swrt myn tlaq ya aazady nhyn hay۔ kha jata hay kh alaq kay many ’’mjbwry‘‘ kay hyn۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3286","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr tlaq jayz hay swayay as kay kh bywqwf ya js ka dmagh khrab hw۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay، awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay، awr ataa bn۔ ajlan ayk zayf snd hay js ky rwayat rd hyn۔"
"3287","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tyn aysay hyn jn kay aamal lkhay nhyn hyn: ayk swta hay jb tk kh wh bydar nh hw jayay، ayk lrka jb tk kh wh blwght kw nh phnch jayay awr ayk bywqwf jb tk kh wh aql pr nh aajayay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3288","darmy nay asay aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt kya hay awr abn majh nay dwnwn ky snd say۔"
"3289","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: lwndy ky tlaq dw bar khnay say hay awr as ky adt dw mrtbh hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3290","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw awrtyn apnay shwhrwn say alg hw jaty hyn awr jw awrtyn apnay shwhrwn kw maawzay kay lyay tlaq dynay pr aamadh krty hyn wh mnafq hyn۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3291","nafa nay abw abyd ky byty sfyh kay ayk mokl ka hwalh dya kh as nay apnay shwhr say apnay pas mwjwd tmam chyzwn kay bdlay myn tlaq lay ly awr yh kh abdallh bn amr nay as pr kwyy aatraz nhyn kya۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3292","mhmwd by lbyd nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ayk aysay shkhs kay baray myn btaya gya js nay apny bywy kw tyn tlaqyn day dy thyn awr an kay drmyan kwyy wqfh nhyn kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm ghsay myn aagyay awr frmaya: kya allh ky ktab say khyla ja rha hay jw azym awr azym hay jb kh myn tmharay drmyan hwn؟ ntyjh yh hwa kh ayk aadmy khra hwa awr khnay lga ya rswl allh kya myn asay qtl kr dwn؟ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3293","malk nay yh sn kr byan kya kh ayk shkhs nay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh say kha۔ abas rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn nay apny bywy kw sw bar tlaq dy hay، tw tmhara kya khyal hay kh myn nay apnay aap kw ks chyz ka zmh dar thhraya hay؟ abn abas rzy allh anh nay jwab dya kh asay tm say tyn batwn say tlaq dy gyy awr stawn say tm nay aayat alhy ka mzaq araya۔ as nay asay almwta myn nql kya hay۔"
"3294","maaz b۔ jbl rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya maaz allh nay rwyay zmyn pr kwyy chyz aysy nhyn bnayy jw asay aazady say zyadh azyz hw awr allh nay rwyay zmyn pr tlaq say zyadh napsndydh kwyy chyz pyda nhyn ky۔ darqtny nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3295","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rfaah qrzy rzy allh anh ky bywy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayy awr kha: ”myry shady rfaah say hwyy thy lykn as nay mjhay tlaq day dy، as kay bad myry tlaq slasy nhyn hwyy، as kay bad myn nay abdalrhmn bn zbyr rzy allh anh say shady kr ly، lykn an kay pas jw kchh tha wh kpray kay knaray ky trh hay۔ as nay as say pwchha kh kya wh rfaah kay pas waps aana chahty hay، lykn jb as nay jwab dya kh as nay aysa kya، tw as nay kha، ''tm as wqt tk nhyn hw sktay jb tk kh abdalrhmn awr tm nay ayk dwsray kay sath hmbstry ky mthas nh dykh ly hw۔'' (bkhary w mslm)"
"3296","‘Abdallah b. Mas'ud said that God’s Messenger cursed the man who made a woman lawful for her first husband and the one for whom she was made lawful.* * This refers to an arrangement to marry a divorced woman and to divorce her after having intercourse so that the one who had divorced her might remarry her. Darimi transmitted it."
"3297","abn majh nay asay aly abn abas awr aqbh bn aqbh say rwayt kya hay۔ ’’aamr۔"
"3298","slyman by ysar nay kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ds say zyadh shabh say mlaqat ky jn myn say sb nay kha kh jw shkhs apny bywy say dwr rhnay ky qsm khata hay asay chahyay kh wh as kay pas waps aajayay ya adt kay akhttam pr asay tlaq day day۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3299","abw slmh nay kha kh slyman bn skhr jsay slamh b bhy khtay hyn۔ skhr albyady nay rmzan almbark kay aakhr tk apny bywy kw apny man ky pyth ky trh bnalya، lykn jb srf aadha mhynh gzra tw as nay rat kw as say hmbstry ky awr rswl allhﷺ kay pas ja kr as ka zkr kya۔ as nay as say kha kh ayk ghlam aazad kr dw، lykn as nay jwab dya kh asay nhyn ml skta۔ tw as nay as say kha kh dw mhynay lgatar rwzay rkhw، lykn as nay jwab dya kh myn aysa nhyn kr skta۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh sath mskynwn kw khana khlao، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh myray pas asbab nhyn hyn، phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frwa say frmaya۔ amrw، asay arq (yany pndrh ya swlh saa khjwr ky twkry) day dw takh wh sath mskynwn kw khana khlayay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ *myn nay trjmh myn arby mhawrh brqrar rkha hay۔ kha jata hay kh yh jmlh zmanh jahlyt myn tlaq ky ayk qsm kay twr pr astamal hwta tha، yany awrt kay sath jmaa kw man kay sath jmaa smjha jata hay۔"
"3300","abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay asy trh ky rwayt slyman bn sqlyn say nql ky hay۔ ysar slamh by kay hwalay say۔ skhr js nay kha، \myn ayk aysa aadmy tha jsay hmbstry kay lyay dwsrwn say zyadh dya jata tha۔\"" abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt ky hay۔ abwdaod awr darmy ky rwayt hay kh ” sath mskynwn kw ayk awnt kay bwjh say khjwr khlao۔"""""
"3301","Sulaiman bin Yasar (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne Salama bin Sakhr (Radi Allahu Anhu) ke hawalay se riwayat kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us shakhs ke baare mein jo apni biwi ko zihar kare (maa ki peeth ki tarah keh de) aur kaffaara (atonement) ada karne se pehle us se humbistari karle, farmaya: \Uski ek hi kaffaara hai.\"" Tirmidhi aur Ibn Majah ne isay riwayat kiya."""""
"3302","akrmh rzy allh anh nay abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky kh ayk aadmy js nay nzr many thy kh wh apny bywy kw apny man ky pyth jysy bna day ga، as nay kfarh dynay say phlay as say jmaa kya، tw wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap say as ka zkr kya۔ as nay as say pwchha kh asay aysa krnay pr ks chyz nay aamadh kya tw as nay jwab dya: \khda kay rswl، myn nay chand ky rwshny myn as ky chandy ky pazyb ky sfydy dykhy awr as kay sath hmbstry krnay say apnay aap kw rwk nh ska۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hns pray awr hkm dya kh jb tk wh kfarh nh day lay as kay qryb nh jayay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay awr trmzy nay bhy asy trh rwayt kya hay kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔ abwdaod awr nsayy nay mkml asnad kay sath awr mrsl ky swrt myn bhy asy trh ky bat nql ky hay، nsayy ka khna hay kh mrsl mkml asnd kay mqablay myn hq kay qryb tr hay۔"""""
"3303","maawyh b۔ alhkm nay byan kya kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr arz kya kh ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas ayk lwndy hay jw myry bhyryn chra rhy thy، myn as kay pas gya tw rywr myn say ayk bkry chhwt gyy، as nay as kay baray myn pwchha، tw as nay btaya kh asay bhyrya kha gya hay، myn as say naraz hwa، awr ansan hwnay kay natay myn nay as kw aazad krnay kay lyay as kay mnh pr ptkh dya۔ wh aazad؟\ khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh khda khan hay tw as nay jwab dya kh wh jnt myn hay۔ as nay as say pwchha kh wh kwn hay tw as nay jwab dya kh wh allh kay rswl hyn۔ phr as nay asay aazad krnay kw kha۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔ mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh as nay kha kh myry ayk lwndy thy jw ahd awr aljwanyh ky trf myry bhyryn chra rhy thy، ayk dn myn nay dykha kh ayk bhyrya hmary ayk bkry kw lay kr chla gya hay، ab myn aysa aadmy hwn jw dwsrwn ky trh naraz hw jata hay، lykn myn nay asay ayk jhtka dya awr phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas chla gya، as nay pwchha kh myn nay asay aazad kr dya، myn nay pwchha kh kya myn nay asay aazad kya؟ myn asay laon awr jb myn nay aysa kya tw as nay as say pwchha kh wh jnt myn hay tw as nay as say pwchha kh wh khda ka rswl hay tw as nay mjhay kha kh asay aazad krdw، kywnkh wh ayk mwmn thy۔"""""
"3304","shl b۔ sad alsady rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh awymr alajlany nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha: mjhay aysay aadmy kay baray myn btayyay jw apny bywy kay sath ayk mrd kw payay، kya wh asay qtl kray awr phr aap kay hathwn qtl kr dya jayay، ya wh kysa aml kray؟\ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""tmharay awr tmhary bywy kay baray myn why nazl hwyy hay، as lyay jao awr asay lay aao۔ shl nay kha kh anhwn nay msjd myn ayk dwsray pr lant bhyjy awr wh an lwgwn kay sath tha jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay۔ phr jb wh fargh hwyay tw awymr nay kha kh agr myn nay asay brqrar rkha tw myn as pr jhwt bwlwn ga awr asay tyn bar tlaq day dy۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay lwgwn say frmaya: dykhw، agr as kay han ayk bchh pyda hwta hay jw syah hay، awr as ky aankhyn bht kaly hyn، bray kwlhwn awr mwty tangyn hyn، tw myn tswr nhyn kr skta kh awymr nay as kay baray myn sch kha hay۔ lykn agr wh srkh dhbwn waly chhpkly jysa srkhy mayl bchh pyda krty hay tw myn yh tswr nhyn kr skta kh awymr nay as kay khlaf jhwt bwla hay۔ as nay ayk bchay kw jnm dya jysa kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay byan kya hay kh awymyr nay sch kha tha awr as kay bad as ka nsb as ky man say chla۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) 1۔ kchh abartyn jysa kh awpr trjmh kya gya hay۔ dwsray tysray shkhs ka astamal krtay hyn، as shkhs kay khandan kay hwalay say awr as kay qtl kay bdlay myn۔ 2. alqraan 24:6۔"""""
"3305","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk mrd awr as ky bywy kw as wqt bddaa dy jb mrd nay apnay bchay say ankar kya awr an dwnwn kw alg kr dya awr bchay kw awrt ky trf mnswb kya۔ an dwnwn ky rwayt myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ansan kw nsyht awr nsyht ky awr btaya kh dnya myn azab aakhrt say zyadh aasan hay۔ phr as nay awrt kw blwaya awr asay nsyht awr nsyht ky awr btaya kh as dnya myn azab aakhrt say zyadh aasan hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3306","anhwn nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an dw lwgwn say jw ayk dwsray pr lant bhyj rhay thay، frmaya: \tmhara hsab allh kay hath myn hay، kywnkh tm myn say ayk jhwta hay۔\"" phr as nay as aadmy say kha kh wh as say dwbarh shady nhyn kr skta، as pr as nay kha، \""khda kay rswl، myry jayydad ka kya hwga؟\"" * as nay jwab dya، \""tmhary kwyy jayydad nhyn hay، agr tm nay sch kha hay، tw yh as ky qymt hay kh tm as kay sath hmbstry ka hq rkhtay hw، awr agr tm nay as kay khlaf jhwt bwla hay، tw yh tm say as say zyadh dwr hay۔\"" * mhr ky adayygy ka hwalh dytay hwyay. (bkhary w mslm)۔"""""
"3307","abn abas nay kha: hlal bn۔ amyh nay nby sly allh alyh wslm ky mwjwdgy myn apny bywy pr shrk bn kay sath zna krnay ka alzam lgaya۔ shma۔ jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an say kha kh sbwt pysh kryn ya apny pyth pr sza bhgtyn tw anhwn nay kha: \khda kay rswl، jb hm myn say kwyy shkhs ksy mrd kw apny bywy say hmbstry krtay hwyay dykhay tw kya wh ja kr sbwt tlb kray؟\"" lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay srf atna jwab dya kh sbwt pysh kryn ya apny pyth pr sza bhgtyn۔ hlal nay phr kha: as ky qsm js nay aap kw hq kay sath bhyja hay، myn sch khh rha hwn، khda kwyy aysy chyz nazl frmayay jw myry pyth kw azab say aazad kr day۔ phr jbrayyl nazl hwyay awr an kay pas layay، \""awr jw apny bywywn pr alzam lgatay hyn،\"" prhtay rhay yhan tk kh wh phnch gyay، \""agr wh sch bwlnay walwn myn say hay\"" (alqraan 24:6-9) phr hlal aayay awr gwahy dy awr nby sly allh alyh wslm frma rhay thay kh allh janta hay kh tm myn say kwyy jhwt bwl rha hay، kya tm myn say kwyy twbh kray ga؟ phr wh awrt athy awr gwahy dy، lykn jb wh panchwyn mrtbh aysa krnay waly thy tw anhwn nay asay rwk dya awr kha kh yh fyslh krnay wala hwga۔ abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh wh phr hchkchayy awr pychhay ht gyy، yhan tk kh an ka khyal tha kh wh apny khy hwyy batwn kw trk kr day gy۔ lykn as kay bad as nay kha، \""myn apnay lwgwn kw hmyshh kay lyay rswa nhyn krwn gy،\"" awr apnay aalan kay sath chly gyy۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an say kha kh dykhw awr dykhw kh kya as nay ayk bchh pyda kya hay js ky aankhyn aysy nzr aaty hyn jysay an myn ayntymwny hay، chwray kwlhwn awr mwty tangyn، kywnkh agr as nay aysa kya tw، sharq bn. shma as ka bap hwga۔ phr jb as nay as byan kay ayk bchay kw jnm dya tw nbyﷺ nay frmaya: ''agr yh nh hwta jw ktab khda myn phlay say byan hwchka hay tw myn as kay sath skhty krta۔'' bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3308","abwhryrh nay kha kh sad bn abadh nay pwchha kh agr mjhay apny bywy kay sath kwyy mrd ml jayay tw kya char gwah lanay say phlay myn asay hath nh lgaon؟ phr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh aysa hy hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hrgz nhyn، myn as ky qsm kha kr khta hwn js nay tmhyn hq kay sath bhyja hay kh myn as say phlay apny tlwar as kay pas lay jaon ga۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw tmhara srdar kya khta hay، wh apny azt pr rshk krta hay، lykn myn as say zyadh ghyrt mnd hwn awr allh mjh say zyadh ghyrt mnd hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3309","mghyrh nay byan kya kh sad bn abadh nay kha kh agr myn ksy aadmy kw apny bywy kay sath dykhta tw myn asay tlwar say marta، nh kh as kay chpay say۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as ky khbr sny tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tmhyn sad ky ghyrt pr tajb hwa؟ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn as say zyadh ghyrt mnd hwn awr khda mjh say zyadh ghyrt mnd hay، khda ky ghyrt ky wjh say as nay khlay awr chhpay mkrwh kamwn kw hram qrar dya hay، ksy kw as bat ka shwq nhyn hay kh wh azr wswl kray awr as nay jng krnay walay say zyadh khwshkhbry dy hw awr as nay jng krnay walay say zyadh khwshkhbry dy hw۔ khda say brh kr kwyy taryf ka dldadh nhyn js ky wjh say khda nay jnt ka wadh kya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3310","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ apny azt pr ghyrt rkhta hay awr mwmn ghyrt mnd hwta hay، allh ky ghyrt as bat pr hay kh mwmn an chyzwn ka artkab nh kray js say allh nay mna kya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
